<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian meat exports fall in Dec 96 - ABS.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian meat exports fall in Dec 96 - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for December 1996 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> December 96   5,905	28	     9,364	3,959</p>
<p> November 96   7,336	68	     9,233	4,882</p>
<p> December 95   4,140     147	     9,458	4,947</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> December 96   53,481	170	   4,304	 696</p>
<p> November 96   58,867	372	   5,100	 864</p>
<p> December 95   65,553	249	   6,979	 728</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
